('36', 'ptl-17050', 'Google Cloud', 'googlecloud@google.com', 'phatthalung@moi.go.th', 'Final call: Don’t get left behind in the agentic era', 'Is your organisation ready for the agentic era?\r\n\r\n\r\nFind out in our new webinar: The Agentic Workplace Blueprint\r\n\r\n\r\nAugust 27, 2026\r\n\r\n\r\n11:45 AM–12:25 PM ICT\r\n\r\nOnline\r\n\r\n\r\nSave my spot <https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXUZZw6FDdFkAYQyFi2TeUL4sHZZYZJjU2XTYRP2AndY90zx-z0qPOVgMsGVGo-xn1y4=>\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nHi สมศักดิ์,\r\n\r\n\r\nIn the agentic era, the businesses taking the lead are the ones who treat agent governance as a competitive advantage. This Thursday, we’re sharing the blueprints for a secure, autonomous workforce – curated specifically for the Asia Pacific region.\r\n\r\nOur new webinar, The Agentic Workplace Blueprint <https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXUZZw6FDdFkAYQyFi2TeUL4sHZZYZJjU2XTYRP2AndY90zx-z0qPOVgMsGVGo-xn1y4=>, will help you master:\r\n \r\n- The blueprint: A step-by-step guide to reimagining everyday work with AI\r\n- The security: Advanced frameworks to block malicious threats while scaling your agents\r\n- The transformation: Practical ways to upskill your team and manage change during the transition\r\n\r\nRegister now <https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXUZZw6FDdFkAYQyFi2TeUL4sHZZYZJjU2XTYRP2AndY90zx-z0qPOVgMsGVGo-xn1y4=> for your roadmap to a more intelligent, connected and productive organisation. \r\n\r\n\r\nSave my spot <https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXUZZw6FDdFkAYQyFi2TeUL4sHZZYZJjU2XTYRP2AndY90zx-z0qPOVgMsGVGo-xn1y4=>\r\n\r\n\r\nSee you there, \r\n The Google Cloud Team\r\n\r\n-----------------------------------------------------\r\n\r\n\r\nNow available on-demand: Beyond the Hype: Turning AI Potential into Business Reality <https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXfZas3ADpOygUAeucMHtO0IsaAvaSxIv5grZZDpc74qDfeONdzbYujEqhOF2fFsJcUU=> Discover how industry leaders are leveraging AI to transform daily operations and accelerate decision-making.\r\n\r\n\r\n© 2026 Google Asia Pacific Pte. Ltd.\r\n 70 Pasir Panjang Road, #03-71, Mapletree Business City, Singapore 117371\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you no longer wish to receive emails from Google Cloud, or would like to customize your communication preferences, please click here <https://cloud.google.com/preferences/?Opt_In_Events__c=Yes&Opt_In_Newsletter__c=Yes&Opt_In_Offers__c=Yes&Opt_In_Products__c=Yes&Opt_In_Research__c=Yes&preferenceCenterSubscription1=Yes&preferenceCenterSubscription2=Yes&preferenceCenterSubscription3=Yes&preferenceCenterSubscription4=Yes>.\r\nBlog\r\n<https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXR0V1GhHbv2aQ_Ki5BJOsWTU05gZz91FN6BXE8k8L7h7Z09bFmxIEehN4snydBMLSOw=>\r\n\r\nGitHub\r\n<https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXQVN0dW0n0QxTub36c9iNcbpB3Y9Cgitw549VylyNe_g7mD76Eck0AVGDJ20Jqlz7Gg=>\r\n\r\nLinkedIn\r\n<https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXWrsmyNEh3XSHTtiF222DrKeIGHNHyk8Ycs1L7VIoI4X20DJkK1732K0JwbXOcBl0SM=>\r\n\r\nTwitter\r\n<https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXZfQy2YCp_Sq1g9mjTl6SvSpP4We1L9boa_2p5YOMafoCiK_WaXuIladU6cnOBIduB0=>\r\n\r\nFacebook\r\n<https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXW2v8-Y4Rwtkw785zzl_Y2kl-2EWP73NlnUXBMdkksilU3xFYl4ZNG_SlN80_hH1y98=>\r\n\r\nYouTube\r\n<https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXeGxMXucHHYt_HJ4Rirhzf-r8f1fq4Smc-oOq7qoaXhOEcsdczavS2hoMSKfh9-VoFg=>\r\n\r\n.', '<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\">\r\n<html lang=\"en\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\r\n<head> \r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"> \r\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"w