22f7-431a-ac4a-9ba26fd58b87\" dir=\"ltr\" bgcolor=\"#1a73e8\" style=\"border-radius: 4px; mso-hide: none;\"><a class=\"whiteText\" href=\r\n\"https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXXxMu0pj8gLPrDbwKA2msRXT8HkELNtuZ1F4V5aER0nUF8ZpiqQIpOR6Mr-XXXFDxlY=\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-family: \'Google Sans\',\'Noto Sans JP\',Arial,sans-serif; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1px; font-weight: bold; -webkit-border-radius: 4px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #1a73e8; margin: 0; padding: 14px 16px 14px 16px; display: inline-block;\"\r\n>Save my spot</a></td> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table> </th> \r\n<th class=\"mobile-block width100 pad-l0 mktoText\" id=\"heroNoFrameOptOut265419fb-c6d2-4c72-b58a-34a11ab4ed58\" style=\"font-weight: normal; text-align: left; padding-left: 24px; display: none !important; mso-hide:all;\" valign=\"middle\"></th> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table> </td> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table> </td> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table>\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"mktoModule\" id=\"bodyCopyModule79cbfe00-803f-4969-b133-bbccfafecb19\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"max-width:600px; width:100%;\"> \r\n<tbody> \r\n<tr> \r\n<td dir=\"ltr\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 50px 8px 50px;\" class=\"inner-container\"> <p class=\"mktoText\" id=\"bodyCopyafd99b79-b864-4596-a6c4-d5514cf644af\" style=\"font-family: \'Google Sans Text\',\'Noto Sans JP\',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left;\">Hi สมศักดิ์,</p> </td> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table>\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"mktoModule\" id=\"bodyCopyModule81783be7-8d58-4c2c-b2c6-1532d4fad735\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"max-width:600px; width:100%;\"> \r\n<tbody> \r\n<tr> \r\n<td dir=\"ltr\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 50px 8px 50px;\" class=\"inner-container\"> <p class=\"mktoText\" id=\"bodyCopy0dd7c53a-2736-410b-9106-93c435fc22e2\" style=\"font-family: \'Google Sans Text\',\'Noto Sans JP\',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left;\">In the agentic era, the businesses taking the lead are the ones who treat agent governance as a competitive advantage. This Thursday, we’re sharing the blueprints for a secure, autonomous workforce – curated specifically for the Asia Pacific region.</p> </td> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table>\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"mktoModule\" id=\"unorderedListModule93ca6a9f-5c0f-4850-8297-9cc614e881ea\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" align=\"center\" style=\"max-width:600px; width:100%;\"> \r\n<tbody> \r\n<tr> \r\n<td dir=\"ltr\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:8px 50px 8px 50px;\" class=\"inner-container\"> \r\n<div class=\"mktoText\" id=\"UnorderedList573baba1-7da8-485b-add8-61b0c2661d6d\" style=\"font-family: \'Google Sans Text\',\'Noto Sans JP\',Arial,sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 24px; color: #5F6368; margin: 0; padding: 0; text-align: left;\">\r\n Our new webinar, \r\n<strong><a href=\r\n\"https://go.cloudplatformonline.com/ODA4LUdKVy0zMTQAAAGj1VzEXXxMu0pj8gLPrDbwKA2msRXT8HkELNtuZ1F4V5aER0nUF8ZpiqQIpOR6Mr-XXXFDxlY=\" target=\"_blank\" id=\"\"\r\n>The Agentic Workplace Blueprint</a></strong>, will help you master: \r\n<ul style=\"padding: 0; margin: 0; margin-left: 20px;\"> \r\n<li><strong>The blueprint:</strong> A step-by-step guide to reimagining everyday work with AI</li> \r\n<li><strong>The security:</strong> Advanced frameworks to block malicious threats while scaling your agents</li> \r\n<li><strong>The transformation:</strong> Practical ways to upskill your team and manage change during the transition</li> \r\n</ul> \r\n</div> </td> \r\n</tr> \r\n</tbody> \r\n</table>\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" class=\"mktoModule\" id